&lt;li&gt;Experience executing sales strategies &amp;amp; sales methodologies like MEDDIC, Challenger Sale, Command of the Message, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent listener who seeks to understand what a customer is trying to achieve rather than pre-supposing solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with typical developer tooling: IDEs, Git, CI/CD, monitoring services, microservices, containers, cloud computing services, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fast learner, excited &amp;amp; willing to learn new technology on an ongoing basis&lt;/li&gt;
