&lt;li&gt;Mentor and inspire internal teams and external collaborators to embrace AI innovation in API contexts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate emerging AI technologies and tools to continuously enhance platform capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
