&lt;li&gt;Partner with world-class colleagues in a pod structure designed to maximize customer impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with some of the largest and most innovative technology companies on the planet.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Play a key role in shaping how Postman goes deeper into enterprise accounts and accelerates platform adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The reasonably estimated OTE for this role is $370,000- $420,000 plus a competitive equity package. Actual compensation is based on the candidate&#39;s skills, qualifications, and experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4036&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What Else?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
