&lt;li&gt;Manage compliance of UKVI programme and other statutory reporting requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain our HRIS system (Workday) and keep other HR tools and systems up-to-date, ensuring a high level of data integrity. Participate in system updates and enhancement projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the Benefits Programs across EMEA countries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain relationships with third party pay and benefits brokers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;General Business Reporting (e.g., New Hires, Terminations, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document Management / Retrieval&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond to Compliance and Legal Inquiries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster strong cross-functional relationships with Payroll, Talent Acquisition and other stakeholders to drive efficiencies and simplify workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Finance/Accounting to manage payroll cycles and other employee compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Function as a subject matter expert and People Operations representative for most employee inquiries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure that we are positioned to scale quickly and efficiently to meet the needs of the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As a member of the People team, uphold and promote Postman’s values; handle sensitive employee relations issues as needed; and support employee engagement initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A minimum of 5 years of general people operations experience or HR generalist experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organizational and project management skills and the ability to execute on large volumes of work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An HRIS and systems guru (Rippling, Workday, DEEL, Zendesk, Greenhouse, or similar systems) with a strong focus on tech based HR solutions and AI platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process-driven problem solver, content with ambiguity and being in the weeds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Empathy and emotional intelligence to build alignment and strong relationships with employees and internal and external stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High integrity and maturity to handle confidential information and sensitive situations in a way that builds trust&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of working in the EMEA region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
