&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Postman hires company builders.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;You enjoy building partner relationships, creating repeatable motions, and helping scale a high-impact channel business as part of one of the best companies in the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The reasonably estimated OTE for this role is $320,000 to $380,000 plus a competitive equity package. Actual compensation is based on the candidate&#39;s skills, qualifications, and experience.&lt;/p&gt;
