&lt;li&gt;Strong experience sourcing for GTM roles (e.g., AEs, ADRs, etc).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in using advanced sourcing tools and platforms (LinkedIn Recruiter, GitHub, X-ray search, Boolean search, Gem, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
